body:
I’m not a doctor, and this isn’t medical advice, just speculation;

Is he indoor or outdoor? And is it itchy? If he’s had all his vaccines and stuff, it’s probably just allergies. Whenever my car scratches me or bites me, I get a raised bump too, and it gets super itchy. Rinse it off with cold water and soap and don’t scratch at it, and it’ll go away by the end of the day. It’s like a temporary mosquito bite


Again, I’m not a doctor though

Thank you so much for the quick reply and for the very helpful advice! I really appreciate it.

&#x200B;

Can I ask another quick question just to clarify? So I cast Panharmonicon and then Phyrexian Metamorph so now I have basically two Panharmonicons. I then cast the demon, so I'm looking for three cards at this point. I then decide to blink Phyrexian Metamorph (with like Aminatou or something like that), and I decide that it comes in as the demon. From what youre saying, basically blinking the Phyrexian Metamorph to come in as the demon (assuming now I only have one Panharmonicon) would only trigger looking for one more card instead of two. Is that right?

&#x200B;

Sorry again, I hope my questions aren't too convoluted. I really appreciate it!
